@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container my-5" style="max-width: 800px;">
    <h1 class="mb-2">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p class="text-muted mb-4">Last updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM yyyy")</p>

    <p>
        SmartGear Online ("we", "us") is committed to protecting your personal
        information in line with South Africa's Protection of Personal Information
        Act (POPIA). This policy explains what information we collect, why we
        collect it, and how it's used.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Information we collect</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>Account details: name, email address, and password (stored securely, never in plain text)</li>
        <li>Order details: shipping address, billing address, and order history</li>
        <li>Customisation details: colours, text, and logo images you upload for custom products</li>
        <li>Usage data: pages visited and actions taken, used only to improve the platform</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 class="mt-4">How we use your information</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>To process and fulfil your orders</li>
        <li>To send order confirmations and status updates</li>
        <li>To respond to support and contact requests</li>
        <li>To maintain account security, including login and lockout protection</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 class="mt-4">What we don't do</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties</li>
        <li>We do not store payment card details on our servers</li>
        <li>We do not share your data with marketers without your consent</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Your rights under POPIA</h4>
    <p>
        You have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your
        personal information at any time. To make a request, contact us using the
        details on our <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">Contact page</a>.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Data security</h4>
    <p>
        Passwords are hashed and never stored in plain text. Account sessions use
        secure, HTTP-only cookies, and repeated failed login attempts trigger a
        temporary account lockout to protect against unauthorised access.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Changes to this policy</h4>
    <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be
        reflected on this page with an updated revision date.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-muted small">
        This is a student project built for academic purposes. This policy is
        provided as a realistic example and should be reviewed by a legal
        professional before use in a live commercial deployment.
    </p>
</div>
